  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "问题1. 一个长方形面积为$\\frac{5}{7}$平方米，它的一边长$\\frac{3}{4}$米，求另一边的长.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 194,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0203#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为长方形面积等于它的长和宽的乘积，所以解题时要求出这样一个数$x$，使$x\\cdot\\frac{3}{4}=\\frac{5}{7}$. 我们知道，如果把$x\\cdot\\frac{3}{4}$的乘积再乘以分数$\\frac{3}{4}$的倒数$\\frac{4}{3}$，就可以求出$x$，也就是$x=\\left(x\\cdot\\frac{3}{4}\\right)\\cdot\\frac{4}{3}$. 因为$x\\cdot\\frac{3}{4}=\\frac{5}{7}$，所以$x=\\frac{5}{7}\\cdot\\frac{4}{3}$. 这样，长方形的另一边长就等于$\\frac{5}{7}\\cdot\\frac{4}{3}=\\frac{20}{21}$（米）.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 194,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0203#8",
        "p0204#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在这个题中，我们求出了$x\\cdot\\frac{3}{4}=\\frac{5}{7}$中的$x$值. 这个$x$值叫做$\\frac{5}{7}$除以$\\frac{3}{4}$所得的商，写成：$x=\\frac{5}{7}:\\frac{3}{4}$. 所以$\\frac{5}{7}:\\frac{3}{4}=\\frac{5}{7}\\cdot\\frac{4}{3}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 195,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "为了求出$x$值，我们把被除数$\\frac{5}{7}$乘以除数的倒数$\\frac{4}{3}$. 一般地说，一个数除以另一个数可以用除数的倒数乘这个数.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 195,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例1. $\\frac{12}{5}:\\frac{16}{15}=\\frac{12}{5}\\cdot\\frac{15}{16}=\\frac{9}{4}=2\\frac{1}{4}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 195,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例2. $\\frac{7}{8}$除以6. 除数$6=\\frac{6}{1}$的倒数是$\\frac{1}{6}$. 就是，$\\frac{7}{8}:6=\\frac{7}{8}\\cdot\\frac{1}{6}=\\frac{7}{48}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 195,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "利用分数除法解应用题.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 195,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "问题2. 清扫了滑冰场（图150）面积的$\\frac{2}{5}$，计800平方米，求滑冰场面积.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 195,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-150",
      "label": "图 150",
      "printed_page": 195,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图150",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 150",
      "printed_page": 195,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们用$x$表示滑冰场的面积. 已知滑冰场面积的$\\frac{2}{5}$等于800平方米，也就是$\\frac{2}{5}x=800$. 为了求出$x$，方程的两边要同除以$\\frac{2}{5}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 195,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#10",
        "p0205#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "就是：$x=800:\\frac{2}{5}=800\\cdot\\frac{5}{2}=2000$. 滑冰场的面积等于2000平方米.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 196,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0205#2"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
